        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARGEO19ENTR, Carre Tall Plate with Rope Georgetown Keyed Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Entry Set Georgetown Leverset with Carre Tall Plate is full of classic beauty. Its sensible styling makes it a great choice for historic homes. The Carre Tall Plate Entrance Set with Georgetown Lever is available in several finish choices. It will fit many pre-drilled doors with a thickness range from 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/georgetown-lever-with-carre-plate-grandeur-cargeo19\"><b>Georgetown Lever with Carre Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Carre Tall Plate Entrance Set with Georgetown Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Grandeur Georgetown Lever with Carre Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARGEO19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262397\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CARGEO19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
